{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"tool_1a6c0ee1-a776-4a5d-bb8e-c1ce201165d","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"#16|issue 16|lane-16","path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"tool_1a6c0ee1-a776-4a5d-bb8e-c1ce201165d","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"#16|issue 16|lane-16","path":"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-15.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":26,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_f4f3840b-9e43-416d-b2c2-1d69e3f2c3a\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"#15|issue 15|preflight\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"glob\":\"*\",\"caseInsensitive\":false,\"multiline\":false,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_f4f3840b-9e43-416d-b2c2-1d69e3f2c3a\",\"offset\":0},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"pattern\":\"#15|issue 15|preflight\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"outputMode\":\"content\",\"workspaceResults\":{\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\":{\"content\":{\"matches\":[{\"file\":\"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-16.stdout\",\"matches\":[{\"lineNumber\":2,\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\\\n\\\\nRead GitHub issue #16 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comme [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":28,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 15 --comments 2>/dev/null; echo \\\"---\\\"; gh issue view 4 --comments 2>/dev/null\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_f4f491ce-bd7b-44f1-93c1-bf7941cf22a\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":true,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"15\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 15 --comments\"},{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"---\\\"\"}],\"fullText\":\"echo \\\"---\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\", [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":29,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_67c0b7a8-7cc0-4971-810f-d5d27f664fc\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"for n in 7 9 10 11 12 13; do echo \\\"======== ISSUE $n ========\\\"; gh issue view $n --comments 2>/dev/null; done\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_67c0b7a8-7cc0-4971-810f-d5d27f664fc\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":true,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"======== ISSUE $n ========\\\"\"}],\"fullText\":\"echo \\\"======== ISSUE $n ========\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"simple_expansion\",\"value\":\"$n\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view $n --comments\"}],\"hasRedirects\":true,\"hasCommandSubstitution\":false,\"allRedirectsAreDevNull\":true,\"redirects\":[{\"operator\":\">\",\"destinationFds\":[2],\"targetNodeType\":\"word\",\"targetText\": [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":43,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_4f5d8725-4a25-4019-8220-03415e35363\",\"tool_call\":{\"grepToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"pattern\":\"issue.*15|#15|lane-15\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"caseInsensitive\":false,\"multiline\":false,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_4f5d8725-4a25-4019-8220-03415e35363\",\"offset\":0},\"result\":{\"success\":{\"pattern\":\"issue.*15|#15|lane-15\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\",\"outputMode\":\"content\",\"workspaceResults\":{\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\":{\"content\":{\"matches\":[{\"file\":\"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-15.stdout\",\"matches\":[{\"lineNumber\":2,\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"role\\\":\\\"user\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\\\n\\\\nRead GitHub issue #15 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comments`). Assume [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":46,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_fd9dc374-9f9f-4508-9d2a-4b27cbb47d2\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"gh issue view 15 2>&1; echo \\\"====BODY====\\\"; gh issue view 15 --json title,body,labels 2>&1\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_fd9dc374-9f9f-4508-9d2a-4b27cbb47d2\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"gh\",\"echo\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":true,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"15\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 15\"},{\"name\":\"echo\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\\\"====BODY====\\\"\"}],\"fullText\":\"echo \\\"====BODY====\\\"\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"15\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--json\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"title,body,labels\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 15 --json title,body,labels\"}],\"hasRedirects\":true [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-16.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\\n\\nRead GitHub issue #16 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comments`). Assume #7–#13 land as ruled. Then read the code on origin/main that #16 touches (src/cli.rs, tests/cli_e2e.rs, and whatever the ticket names).\\n\\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\\n1. Contradictions between #16, #4, the rulings and the code.\\n2. Defaults or formats #16 leaves unstated that the lane must pick.\\n3. Failure cases with no stated behaviour.\\n4. Acceptance criteria that fight the spec or the code.\\nFor each give your recommended ruling in a few words, preferring the smallest change. End with a STATUS line.\\n\\nAlso read the #6 probe findings comment on #4 and the recorded fixtures under tests/fixtures/ (pi/, claude/, cursor/) on origin/ [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":6,"content":"{\"type\":\"t