rsor is the only implementation; behaviour is unchanged.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Nothing outside the cursor backend knows cursor-agent's flags or stream format.\\n- [ ] Cursor parser tests run on the recorded cursor fixtures.\\n- [ ] All existing tests pass unchanged.\\n\\n## Blocked by\\n\\n- #13 Contract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\",\"title\":\"Backend split (prefactor)\"}\n","stderr":"","executionTime":1005,"interleavedOutput":"{\"body\":\"## Parent\\n\\n#4\\n\\n## What to build\\n\\nPrefactor for the new backends. Each backend owns its binary resolution, argument building from (model, capability, cwd, session), stream parsing into the progress snapshot and a normalized result (text, session id, usage, optional reported cost, error), resume method, and doctor checks. The model table's `backend` field selects it. Cost comes from the model table unless the backend reports its own.\\n\\nCursor is the only implementation; behaviour is unchanged.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Nothing outside the cursor backend knows cursor-agent's flags or stream format.\\n- [ ] Cursor parser tests run on the recorded cursor fixtures.\\n- [ ] All existing tests pass unchanged.\\n\\n## Blocked by\\n\\n- #13 Contract: remove MCP and rename to delegate\",\"title\":\"Backend split (prefactor)\"}\n","localExecutionTimeMs":753},"isBackground":false},"description":"Fetch issue #15 backend split ticket"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_0fdd3d92-b3f9-45e9-babc-84140285c4e","startedAtMs":"1790845589685","completedAtMs":"1790845590860"},"model_call_id":"386feff0-e8c0-4a47-a111-127accad2785-3-uktp","session_id":"24a298ed-5281-4d0f-b4ee-9f5363059aa8","timestamp_ms":1790845590849}
