{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 1. Contradictions\n- **#16 is blocked by #15/#6, not #7–#13 alone** — Ruling: require #15 backend split (+ #11 model table) landed before #16.\n- **`origin/main` `supervise` hardcodes cursor `build_argv`, adapter, `backend: \"cursor\"`** — Ruling: dispatch by model `backend` after #15.\n- **`models.json` on main has no pi ids and uses `family`; spec/#11 use `backend`** — Ruling: follow #11 table shape first.\n- **#11 interim `backend not implemented` for pi vs #16 enabling pi** — Ruling: delete stub when pi ships.\n- **#6: pi bad-model exits 0; cursor/cli treat exit code as success signal** — Ruling: ERROR from `stopReason`/`errorMessage`, ignore exit code.\n- **#7 second `delegate.rs` bin vs #13 single binary** — Ruling: #13 wins.\n\n## 2. Unstated defaults\n- **Fake/real pi binary override env name** — Ruling: `PI_BIN`, mirror `CURSOR_AGENT_BIN`.\n- **Read-only + pi wording and exit code** — Ruling: exit 2 per #7 bad-input pattern.\n- **Run cost aggregation** — Ruling: sum `message_end` assistant `usage.cost.total` (#6 open item).\n- **`--session-id` value on first run** — Ruling: generate uuid, store in record, reuse on resume.\n- **Resume argv** — Ruling: same `--session-id` as fixtures, not cursor `--resume`.\n\n## 3. Failure cases (unstated)\n- **Pi stderr “creating a new session” on first `--session-id`** — Ruling: non-fatal stderr only.\n- **SIGTERM mid-stream (`pi/cancelled`, no terminal line)** — Ruling: supervisor sets CANCELLED (#6), not parser.\n- **Empty assistant text with `stopReason: error`** — Ruling: terminal ERROR with `errorMessage` text.\n\n## 4. Acceptance vs spec/code\n- **E2E resume/cancel/watch on main CLI only has `run`/`watch`** — Ruling: depends on #10; don’t claim #16 alone.\n- **Parser AC lists answer/tool/resume/error only; fixtures include needs-context/cancelled** — Ruling: add those parser tests.\n- **Body requires pi doctor; AC omits it** — Ruling: doctor stays #11; #16 only wires `auth check --model` if #11 done.\n- **#15 “all tests unchanged” vs new pi tests** — Ruling: additive tests only.\n\n## Fixture parser deltas (pi vs cursor/claude)\nPi NDJSON: no `type:result`; final text from last assistant `message_end` / `agent_end`; session id from `type:session` `id` (not result `session_id`); cost nested under `usage.cost`; tools are `tool_execution_*` not cursor `tool_call`; skip `entry_appended`, `agent_settled`, `turn_*`, redacted system noise; errors via `stopReason: error` with exit 0. Claude/cursor share `result` lines and hook/thinking noise pi lacks.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS"}]},"session_id":"24a298ed-5281-4d0f-b4ee-9f5363059aa8"}
