nclude needs-context/cancelled** — Ruling: add those parser tests.\n- **Body requires pi doctor; AC omits it** — Ruling: doctor stays #11; #16 only wires `auth check --model` if #11 done.\n- **#15 “all tests unchanged” vs new pi tests** — Ruling: additive tests only.\n\n## Fixture parser deltas (pi vs cursor/claude)\nPi NDJSON: no `type:result`; final text from last assistant `message_end` / `agent_end`; session id from `type:session` `id` (not result `session_id`); cost nested under `usage.cost`; tools are `tool_execution_*` not cursor `tool_call`; skip `entry_appended`, `agent_settled`, `turn_*`, redacted system noise; errors via `stopReason: error` with exit 0. Claude/cursor share `result` lines and hook/thinking noise pi lacks.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS","session_id":"24a298ed-5281-4d0f-b4ee-9f5363059aa8","request_id":"386feff0-e8c0-4a47-a111-127accad2785","usage":{"inputTokens":44177,"outputTokens":5435,"cacheReadTokens":322432,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
